Package: cybroid-edition-network
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CybroidOS maintainers <citos@cybroid.com>
Homepage: https://cybroid.com/cybroidos
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: cybroid-plasma (>= @VERSION@), wireshark, tshark, nmap, zenmap, tcpdump, iperf3, mtr-tiny, traceroute, arping, fping, hping3, arp-scan, iftop, nethogs, ethtool, iw, wavemon, lldpd, speedtest-cli, picocom, cutecom, telnet, sshpass, expect, tftpd-hpa, tftp-hpa, dnsmasq, filezilla, remmina, snmp, ipcalc, sipcalc, frr, vpcs, python3-scapy, python3-netmiko, python3-paramiko, ansible
Description: CybroidOS Network: for network engineers and students
 Capture, testing, console and automation tools: Wireshark, Nmap with
 Zenmap, tcpdump, iperf3, mtr, traceroute, fping, hping3, arp-scan;
 bandwidth monitors (iftop per host, nethogs per program) and Wi-Fi tools
 (iw, wavemon); serial consoles (picocom, and CuteCom with a window) and
 Telnet for older devices; a TFTP server for device configs and firmware, dnsmasq
 for lab DHCP and DNS; FileZilla and Remmina; SNMP tools, subnet
 calculators; FRRouting and VPCS for practice; and Ansible, Netmiko,
 Paramiko and Scapy for automation. MikroTik's WinBox installs from the App
 Centre. Pairs with the CIT platform's network labs.
 .
 The same CybroidOS as every edition (look, updates, Hangar), with these
 tools added. An installed CybroidOS becomes this edition by installing this
 package; several editions can be installed together.
